97e67825-47f7-4808-be7a-1896b13019d0	{"question": "What should be done when a Child Protection Officer is submitting a report to Tusla?"}	{"answer": "The Child Protection Officer or individual acting on behalf of the Child Protection Officer should inform a parent/guardian that a report is being made and the reasons for the decision to report except where any of the conditions at (1) to (3) above apply. In any case, where an MP is submitting a report to Tusla, the Child Protection Officer, rather than the MP concerned, shall assume the responsibility for informing the parent/guardian."}	\N	cmrv9r5aj0001o007jnkiqjhg	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	ACTIVE	\N	\N	cmrtp2m3m000610fjbampscbo	f	2026-07-21 23:14:27.764	\N
dfb512ac-e3d9-48fd-8ed3-4aaf9720e3ac	{"question": "What should be done when a record of information communicated by the Child Protection Officer or their nominee to the parent/guardian is made?"}	{"answer": "A decision by the Child Protection Officer not to inform a parent/guardian shall be recorded together with the reasons for not doing so."}	\N	cmrv9r5aj0001o007jnkiqjhg	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	ACTIVE	\N	\N	cmrtp2m3m000610fjbampscbo	f	2026-07-21 23:14:27.764	\N
32e28530-5ce6-452a-8d5d-69dd1c2d9c75	{"question": "What should be done when there is any doubt as to whether to inform a parent/guardian that a report is being made?"}	{"answer": "The Child Protection Officer or their nominee shall seek and record the advice of Tusla."}	\N	cmrv9r5aj0001o007jnkiqjhg	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	ACTIVE	\N	\N	cmrtp2m3m000610fjbampscbo	f	2026-07-21 23:14:27.764	\N
ed2f048f-89f2-46b8-9f57-eae345219982	{"question": "What is required when considering a retrospective application where extenuating circumstances exist?"}	{"answer": "The student has extenuating circumstances, there is no other available solution for the student given their circumstances, and the student has not been engaged in any programme activity for the period of the withdrawal they are requesting."}	\N	cmrv9r5aj0001o007jnkiqjhg	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	ACTIVE	\N	\N	cmrtp2m3m000610fjbampscbo	f	2026-07-21 23:14:27.764	\N
616cabe1-32be-47a8-8941-ce80fbbcaa7c	{"question": "What should UCD Registry do if a retrospective withdrawal application is approved?"}	{"answer": "UCD Registry should remove a student’s academic history relating to the approved retrospective withdrawal period from their student record via existing delegated authority mechanisms."}	\N	cmrv9r5aj0001o007jnkiqjhg	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	2026-07-21 23:14:27.773	ACTIVE	\N	\N	cmrtp2m3m000610fjbampscbo	f	2026-07-21 23:14:27.764	\N
